WEBVTT

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:03.633
For eleven months, one watch counted every heartbeat.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.867
358 activities.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:08.900
1,431 kilometres.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.733
Walks, runs, hikes, and the gym.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:17.767
In atlas mode, every route comes back as light.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.333
272 days on the move.

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.567
153 of them in a row.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.067
Pick any day, and it plays again.

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.367
Ten set out together.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:33.533
One stays at every moment that mattered, all the way to the finish.

00:00:37.867 --> 00:00:40.567
44 variables become 34 facts.

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:40.767
1.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:42.233
5 million steps.

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:43.333
6 am starts.

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:45.833
And Sundays carry the week.

00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:50.133
Watch it as a story, or dig through the tabs.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.900
Every number, straight from the watch.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.467
Come and find your day:

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:58.400
sankettambare.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.133
in/training
